### Preference Keys and Definitions

**File:** `/Volumes/Dumpy/Research/automated_program_repair_for_ui_bugs/runs/claude_original_run1/bug-71/app/src/main/res/xml/preferences.xml`

1. **"enable-favorites-bar"** (Line 79)
   - User label: "Show favorites above search bar"
   - Default: `true`
   - Summary when ON: "Display favorites above the search bar"
   - Summary when OFF: "Only display favorites when pressing the KISS icon"

2. **"favorites-hide"** (Line 176)
   - User label: "Hide favorites bar initially"
   - Default: `false`
   - Dependency: `history-hide` (only visible when minimalistic mode is enabled)

3. **"history-hide"** (Line 165)
   - User label: "Minimalistic UI"
   - Default: `false`
   - This is the parent preference controlling minimalistic mode

