### File: Favorites.java (Forwarder)
**Path:** `/Volumes/Dumpy/Research/automated_program_repair_for_ui_bugs/runs/claude_original_run1/bug-71/app/src/main/java/fr/neamar/kiss/forwarder/Favorites.java`

**Multiple visibility toggle call sites:**

1. **Line 86-94:** `onCreate()` - Initializes which favorites bar to use
   - If `enable-favorites-bar` is true, uses external favorites bar and hides embedded bar
   - If `enable-favorites-bar` is false, uses embedded bar and hides external bar
   ```java
   void onCreate() {
       if (isExternalFavoriteBarEnabled()) {
           mainActivity.favoritesBar = mainActivity.findViewById(R.id.externalFavoriteBar);
           // Hide the embedded bar
           mainActivity.findViewById(R.id.embeddedFavoritesBar).setVisibility(View.INVISIBLE);
       } else {
           mainActivity.favoritesBar = mainActivity.findViewById(R.id.embeddedFavoritesBar);
           // Hide the external bar
           mainActivity.findViewById(R.id.externalFavoriteBar).setVisibility(View.GONE);
       }
   ```

2. **Lines 195-201:** `updateSearchRecords()` - Shows/hides favorites bar based on search query
   ```java
   void updateSearchRecords(String query) {
       if (query.isEmpty()) {
           mainActivity.favoritesBar.setVisibility(View.VISIBLE);
       } else {
           mainActivity.favoritesBar.setVisibility(View.GONE);
       }
   }
   ```

3. **Lines 203-208:** `onDataSetChanged()` - Hides external favorites bar when viewing all apps
   ```java
   void onDataSetChanged() {
       // Do not display the external bar when viewing all apps
       if (mainActivity.isViewingAllApps() && isExternalFavoriteBarEnabled()) {
           mainActivity.favoritesBar.setVisibility(View.GONE);
       }
   }
   ```

4. **Line 226-228:** `isExternalFavoriteBarEnabled()` - Helper method
