   ```

4. **Lines 304-310:** Helper methods
   ```java
   private boolean isMinimalisticModeEnabled() {
       return prefs.getBoolean("history-hide", false);
   }

   private boolean isMinimalisticModeEnabledForFavorites() {
       return prefs.getBoolean("history-hide", false) && 
              prefs.getBoolean("favorites-hide", false) && 
              prefs.getBoolean("enable-favorites-bar", true);
   }
   ```

   **Key insight:** `isMinimalisticModeEnabledForFavorites()` requires ALL three conditions:
   - "history-hide" = true (Minimalistic UI enabled)
   - "favorites-hide" = true (Hide favorites bar initially enabled)
   - "enable-favorites-bar" = true (External favorites bar enabled)

